  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ECW MYRP South Sudan Phase 2 (2023-2026)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Phase 2 of the ECW-funded MYRP programme in South Sudan. This three-year project aims to increase the number of children and adolescents going to, and staying in, school, improve the quality of education and school facilities, and in particular target the enrolment and retention of girls and young women. Plan International is an implementing partner and the Gender Lead Organisation for the grantee consortium.</narrative>
  </description>
